<IndustryPage {...pageData}>
<p>The UK property market is competitive, and estate agents and property firms that win are the ones that operate efficiently and deliver a seamless digital experience. Bespoke software can help you manage properties better, track leads more effectively, and give clients the self-service portal they now expect - but most agencies are still juggling a CRM that doesn't understand property, a separate listing management tool, and spreadsheets for everything in between.</p>
<p>Off-the-shelf estate agency software was built for a market that no longer exists. Legacy CRM systems treat every lead the same whether it's a first-time buyer or a portfolio landlord. They can't automate the specific nurture sequences that different client types need. Property management tools handle rent collection but fall apart on complex multi-let arrangements, HMO licensing tracking, or deposit protection compliance. Generic booking systems don't understand viewing availability tied to specific properties, agent schedules, and vendor preferences - so coordinators end up managing viewings by phone and spreadsheet.</p>
<p>We build custom software for UK estate agents, letting agents, and property management firms. We understand property workflows - from valuations and viewings to tenancy management and completion - and we build systems that integrate with Rightmove, Zoopla, and your existing tools. Whether it's a bespoke CRM that nurtures leads based on property type and buyer profile, a property management platform that tracks tenancy compliance automatically, or a tenant portal that handles maintenance requests and rent payments, bespoke software fits your exact workflow.</p>
<p>Property compliance is increasingly complex. Right to Rent checks, Tenant Fees Act compliance, deposit protection schemes, EPC and gas safety certificate tracking, and AML requirements on large transactions all demand robust record-keeping. Bespoke software can automate compliance tracking, send expiry alerts for certifications, and generate audit-ready documentation - eliminating the risk of penalties for missed deadlines.</p>
<p>A UK lettings agency managing 300 properties across two branches was struggling with tenancy compliance - deposit registrations were occasionally missed, and gas safety renewals relied on a single administrator's calendar. We built a bespoke property management system that automated deposit protection, tracked certificate expiry dates with escalation alerts, and generated compliance reports for management meetings. Compliance breaches dropped to zero within four months, and the agency secured a larger portfolio acquisition partly because their compliance systems impressed the vendor.</p>
<p>From property management platforms and tenant portals to CRM systems and listing syndication, bespoke software is already delivering real ROI for forward-thinking UK property firms. The opportunity is replacing fragmented spreadsheets and off-the-shelf tools with software that fits your exact workflow.</p>

